			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750790701,
					"content": "這裡就讓我作為人生的前輩、你的兄長，來好好教教你怎樣融入集體，同時成為一個受歡迎的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790702,
					"content": "多謝你的好意，但是我不需要。再說了，你也不是我的兄長…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塔盧加"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790703,
					"content": "還有，可以請你不要再餵奧伯龍吃餅乾了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塔盧加"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790704,
					"content": "嗚嗚，啊嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧伯龍"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790705,
					"content": "不懂事的小鬼，要不是看在你姐的面子上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790706,
					"content": "打擾了，我來領獎品。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750790707,
					"content": "呀！呀呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790708,
					"content": "#哦，這還真是稀罕的客人，小嵴鋒龍在我們這裡可不常見。還有這邊的…{F#妳}{M#你}的夥伴品種真是多樣啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790709,
					"content": "#品種…我跟{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}才不一樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790710,
					"content": "嗯？嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790711,
					"content": "#欸？不是，我們都是{NICKNAME}的夥伴沒錯，但是也不完全一樣吧？呃…不一樣的意思不是說誰更好誰不好，所以不要難過啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790712,
					"content": "無意說出的真心話才最致命…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790713
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750790713,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}明明知道我不是那個意思，就不要讓問題變得更複雜啦。{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也是我們的好夥伴哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790714,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也是好夥伴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790715
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750790715,
					"content": "嗚嗚？呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790716,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，我就知道{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是聰明小龍，一定不會誤會我的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790717,
					"content": "真是叫人羨慕的默契。看你們的裝束也不是在地人，卻能和小嵴鋒龍有這樣深厚的信賴和友誼，是不是有什麼訣竅？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790718,
					"content": "實不相瞞，塔盧加和他的小絨翼龍雖然是搭檔，相處得卻並不好。如果有什麼融洽相處的訣竅，真想讓他學一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790719,
					"content": "比起我的事…他們的獎品呢？該不會還沒準備好吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塔盧加"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790720,
					"content": "當然準備好了！你很會轉移話題嘛，算了，這個先不提…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750790721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				},
				{
					"id": 750790721,
					"content": "近期還會舉辦飛行競賽，如果幾位有興趣的話千萬不要錯過觀賽的機會，不要錯過我精彩的表演！我還有事，就先告辭了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "拉密薩納"
				}
			]
		},
		{
